OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a rather mild and cloudy
OL,6,Fstart, Friday will be a mostly dry day
OL,7,Fwith plenty of sunny spells. Winds
OL,8,Fwill be generally light and it will
OL,9,Ffeel pleasantly warm in the sunshine,
OL,10,Fbut fresher that of late.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry night will follow with
OL,13,Fclear spells and generally light winds
OL,14,Ffor all. Feeling rather cool and fresh
OL,15,Ffor all.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FWinds reaming generally
OL,18,Flight with plenty of sunny spells. An
OL,19,Fisolated light shower is possible, but
OL,20,Fmost of us staying dry. Feeling
OL,21,Fpleasant in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
