OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry with sunny spells on Sunday. Some
OL,7,Frain or thundery showers likely on
OL,8,FMonday and Tuesday, but mainly dry.
OL,9,FTurning a little warmer too.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
